* synthetic: a case built so the normalisation B = [I_r; B2] is the WRONG one.
*
* y1 and y2 cointegrate (y2 = y1 + noise); y3 is an independent random walk
* with no relation to either.  Column order puts y3 in the Y1 block, so the
* fit is asked to normalise the cointegrating vector on a series that does not
* appear in it -- B2 inflates and the model describes something else.
*
* drvec's normalisation check reports 0.6% and warns.  That is what this file
* is for: an alarm with no case to fire on is not an alarm.  Generated once
* with a fixed seed and committed, because a golden result needs a fixed input.
